    "summary": "[Divine Intervention](vsdata:ability/adepta-sororitas.hallowed-martyrs.divine-intervention) gets a new Target and Effect. It targets 1 **ADEPTA SORORITAS CHARACTER** model of yours that was just **destroyed**, and can be used on it despite that. Its effect:\n\n1. You may discard 1 to 3 Miracle dice.\n2. As the phase ends, set the model up on the battlefield **unengaged**, as near as it can be to the place it was destroyed.\n3. Roll a D3 and add 1 per discarded Miracle die: the model has that many wounds left, capped at its starting wounds.\n\nThe model is in no **attached unit**, and its unit's **starting strength** is 1.",
